    'tip.box': '<b>Box gacha</b> (a gacha without duplicates) is a gacha where pulled items leave the pool, so it can be emptied completely.<br><br>You can find it in Fate/Grand Order and Blue Archive. At the time this app was released the system was used by Maki\'s “Red Riding Hood” banner and Kaito\'s “Grey Wolf” banner, and it is also used by the permanent “First Sonata” banner.<br><br>It is rare on main premium-currency banners: box gacha was common in Japanese mobile and browser games of the early to mid 2010s. It is considered less profitable for developers because the player knows exactly how much the guaranteed prize costs.',
