    'eco.bGone': 'Note: after you buy a bundle, or when a promo ends, it may disappear from the shop. If that happens, delete it here too.',
    'bd.firstStep': '“First Step of Hope” Pack',
    'bd.impulse': '“Sincere Impulse” Pack',
    'bd.verdict': '“Individual Verdict” Pack',
    'bd.dynasty': 'Limited “Dynasty Legacy” Pack',
    'bd.seals': '“Seals of Truth” Pack',
    'bd.noReturn': '“Point of No Return” Pack',
    'tips.5': '<b>Always try to keep enough in stock to pull one banner completely.</b> If you suddenly need to get something you did not plan for and have no money at hand, this reserve can really save you.',
    'tips.6': '<b>Odds in the Despair Roulette.</b> According to the Shinri Trial support team\'s answer on Discord, the cylinder holds from 0 to 2 live rounds, and each of these three loadouts is equally likely. If the shooter fires a live round at themselves, the roulette ends immediately. Calculating shot odds was originally planned for this calculator, but as you can see, there turned out to be nothing to calculate ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯',
    'tips.7': '<b>Watch for promo codes in the official news channels.</b> This is one of two ways to get a Seal of Intervention. The other is to buy the “Seals of Truth” Pack with three Seals of Intervention in the shop, but that pack can only be bought once.',
    'tips.8': '<b>Did you know there is a site called [kirigiri](https://www.kirigiris.press/guidebook)?</b> There you can find out [where each item spawns](https://www.kirigiris.press/guidebook/items), [what traces different weapons leave on the bodies](https://www.kirigiris.press/guidebook/weapons) or, for example, [how many capsules will be available in the peaceful ending](https://www.kirigiris.press/guidebook/repairs) when the door opens (see the end of the “Repairs” section).',
    'tips.9': '<b>If your account has not reached level 5 yet,</b> you can get a free name change item once by redeeming a promo code from one of the media personalities. There is one such code on the [kirigiri](https://www.kirigiris.press/guidebook) site from the previous tip 😉 Without it, changing your name costs money.',
    'tips.go': 'Tip {n}'
